  "text_pages": [
    "Exchange/Visiting Pre-Arrival Guide - c. RC Application\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nRC Application\nRC Application instructions\nStudents may apply for the RC using two methods,\nApplied individually by student,\nApplied through the visa agency,\nHireVisa\n(Only available for Seoul Campus students)\nApplying Individually\nStudents require the following documents to apply for their RC individually at the Sejongno (Seoul Campus) / Suwon (Global Campus) Immigration Office.\nPlease note that students MUST make an\nonline appointment\nat the Sejongno Immigration Office before their visit for application.\nRequired Documents\n1. Certificate of Current Enrollment\nThe certificate can be collected from the Office of International Admissions and Management (OIAM).\n2. Confirmation of Residence\nOn campus residents\n: Form must be signed by the GlobeeDorm office (Seoul), or International House office (Seoul), or HUFS Dorm office (Global).\nOff campus residents\n:\nHousing contract and a copy of your landlord's ID is required.\n3. RC Application Form\nThe following application form must be completed and submitted (\nDownload a copy\n)\n.\n4. Passport Information Page\nPassport information page must be clear and easy to read. Physical passport should be brought along to immigration office at the time of application.\n5. Confirmation of Visa Issuance\nM\nust be clear and easy to read. Physical passport should be brought along to immigration office at the time of application.\n6. 3.5X4.5 ID Card Photo\nThis is a standard passport photo that meets international standards.\nIMPORTANT: Photo MUST show both side of ears and be of high quality.\n7. Reservation Receipt\nAppointment receipt from made appointment through the Immigration Office website.\n8. ARC Application Fee\nThe application fee is 35,000 KRW.\n2. Applying through HireVisa (Seoul campus)\nHireVisa is a visa agency in Korea with English services available for international students.\nThere will be two rounds of application through HireVisa. Students will need to complete the online application form.\nName\n: HireVisa\nWebsite\n:\nhttps://www.hirevisa.com/hufs\nMethod\n: Online\nPeriod\n:\nTBC\nCost\n: Immigration Fee (3\n5\n,000 KRW) and Agency Fee (1\n5\n,000 KRW) -\n50\n,000 KRW Total\nRequired Documents\nID photo (see dimensions above)\nPassport\nConfirmation of Residence\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
